---
source: AI
serves: 4
cook time: 2.5 hours
prep time: 5 minutes
tags:
  - side
---

Prep the potatoes: Wash and dry @sweet potatoes{4} thoroughly, then pierce each several times with a #fork{} so steam can escape. Skip the oil.

Set up the smoker: Preheat the #smoker{} to 225°F - 250°F. Use mild woods like apple, cherry, or pecan.

Smoke low and slow: Place directly on the smoker grates for 2 to ~{2.5%hours} (up to 3 hours for extra-large potatoes).

Check for doneness: They are ready when skins are slightly wrinkled and a fork glides through the thickest center with zero resistance.
